# The agreement again, each keyword and word in any of the three languages.
contract Agreement
訂約方 we, 客户

record Terms
  terms 文字
  amount 港元
  starts date

can amend 由 本公司 with new_amount HKD, new_start 日期
  須 proposed
  requires 經 customer 同意
  须 new_amount > HKD 0
  如 new_amount > 金額 * 150%
    reject "an amendment may raise the amount by half at most"
  否則
    amount = new_amount
  starts = new_start
可 sign by 客戶
  over 1_000_000 須親身確認
  requires now < starts
  已提議 -> signed
can countersign 由 we
  signed -> effective
可 close by 本公司
  须 经 客户 同意
  effective -> closed
